---------------------------- MODULE DistributedTransactionConfig ----------------------------
EXTENDS DistributedTransaction, Integers

CONSTANT Keys, Clients
VARIABLES msgQueue, clientState, commitStatus, writeSets, readSets, lockSets, ts

Init == DistributedTransaction!Init
Next == DistributedTransaction!Next

TypeOK == ...
UniqueCommitOrAbort == ...
CommitConsistency == ...
AbortConsistency == ...
WriteConsistency == ...
UniqueWrite == ...
UniqueLockOrWrite == ...
OptimisticReadSnapshotIsolation == ...
PessimisticReadSnapshotIsolation == ...
MsgTsConsistency == ...

Keys == {k1, k2}
Clients == {c1, c2}

ClientClassification == [c1 |-> "pessimistic", c2 |-> "optimistic"]
ClientReadKeys == [c1 |-> {}, c2 |-> {k1, k2}]
ClientWriteKeys == [c1 |-> {k1, k2}, c2 |-> {k1, k2}]
ClientPrimaryKeys == [c1 |-> k1, c2 |-> k1]

